  m_text: "G\xDCMR\xDCK KURALLARI\n\nHer ge\xE7i\u015F kay\u0131t alt\u0131na al\u0131n\u0131r.\n\n  An\u0131lar, ge\xE7i\u015F bedeli olarak kabul edilir.\n\n  Ge\xE7i\u015F izni olmadan kap\u0131lardan \xE7\u0131k\u0131lamaz.\n\n  \u0130\xE7eri giren ki\u015Fi ile d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 \xE7\u0131kan ki\u015Finin ayn\u0131 olmas\u0131 garanti edilmez."
